!.env.example

# Never commit private Firebase Admin/service-account credentials or local
# one-time catalog exports to source control.
*firebase-adminsdk*.json
*service-account*.json
catalog-export*.json

# Private legacy exports and generated D1 staging SQL may contain personal,
# financial and order data. Never publish/commit them.
*aurora*export*.json
*aurora*stage*.sql
*aurora*backup*.sql
*aurora*backup*.json
*.d1-backup.sql
